Z||000000||noyb||01-19-2001||03:56 PM||||Just recently discovered the forum and now I'm like a kid with a new toy.  I'm up all night reading and learning!  Bought an 86SE last summer that had been sitting in a field for five years.  No marks on it, except for the oxidized paint, and dirty interior.  Paid a grand total of $100.00 for it!  I've been dreaming for a the last six months of a total restoration and modification.  As soon as winter is over, I will bring it out of storage and begin my love affair with this car.  Now for the question!  I've read several opinions concerning engine upgrades, but I want to put the question to you this way;  given cost, performance, simplicity, and availability, which engine upgrade offers the best total value for those four factors mentioned above.<P>Thanks!||||reg||6
